case|source value|CSVX representation|converter note
not a number|NaN|:nan:|numeric error or NaN cell
positive infinity|∞|:inf:|converter chooses supported mapping
negative infinity|-∞|:ninf:|converter chooses supported mapping
not available|#N/A|:na:|spreadsheet error cell
divide by zero|#DIV/0!|:div0:|sugar for a specific error
missing reference|#REF!|:nref:|reference error
invalid value|#VALUE!|:nvalue:|value error
unknown name|#NAME?|:nname:|name error
numeric overflow|#NUM!|:nnum:|numeric error
repeating decimal|0.1(3)|0.1 :periodic(3):|prefix plus repetend
